				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>So he's having a wonderful time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a6" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts10" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts11">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I hope you're enjoying the project.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a7" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts12" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts13">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It is always fun.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a8" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts14" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts15">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I wrote another biography of Jean Van Heyenert.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a9" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts16" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts17">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't know if you know, so it's a biography and a lot of that was done by interview, a lot of it interview with him.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a10" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts18" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts19">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Jan van Heyert was a mathematician, logician who had been Trotsky's secretary and bodyguard and translator for many years.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a11" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts20" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts21">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And yeah, he had a very, very interesting life.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a12" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts22" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts23">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And so I did that was a very exciting very exciting Charlie are young?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a13" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts24" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts25">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Are you in the Castle project?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a14" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts26" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts27">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I would say maybe a quarter of the way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a15" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts28" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts29">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sol's just gotten dragged into it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a16" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts30" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts31">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He's now and he's not wanting to do his part for a while.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a17" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts32" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts33">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I'm doing more the personality, the general story, the historical scene, and I think Saul will be expert on the work in his Do you have a lot of Polish material?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a18" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts34" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts35">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I have a fair amount, not a whole lot, but I have a lot of I have some personal information and there's historical material, of course, and things to read about period.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a19" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts36" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts37">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>The whole Polish mathematical scene, of course, was incredibly interesting.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a20" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts38" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts39">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And the whole period between the wars in Poland, that period from nineteen eighteen to nineteen thirty nine was a very, very fruitful period in all aspects.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a21" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts40" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts41">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Intellectual and cultural life was just flourished, a real Renaissance and Tarski was part of that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a22" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts42" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts43">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>So those were his He was born in thirty he was born in nineteen oh one and he left in ' thirty nine.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a23" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts44" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts45">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He left just to come for a lecture and then was here when the war started, so to stay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a24" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts46" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts47">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I think the thing that caught my attention most about you in this book was the point where you actually there's she writes that you went to discuss with Tarsi the possibility of working in Yeah, I wanted to work with him and then got pulled back.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a25" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts48" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts49">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Got pulled back.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a26" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts50" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts51">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>So tell me a little about that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a27" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts52" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts53">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, I don't really I kept, you know, long ago and it was a very turbulent times I knew.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a28" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts54" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts55">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I was actually not so much interested in logic but in the university algebra that he was at that time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a29" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts56" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts57">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>That took once and I had talked with him and he said he'd be happy to work with me but then it didn't work out when the statistics would Evans pushed me into statistics because of the war he felt that I should go back to work rather than the right of work.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a30" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts58" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts59">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I went see Nin and then if you ready to do I didn't look particularly like it after a year and was going to go back to the African and then they offered me a job and I just thought I couldn't turn that down.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a31" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts60" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts61">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It turned out very well for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a32" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts62" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts63">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I probably did much better in statistics than I really would have done, although it's much further away from what I really want to do in life.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a33" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts64" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts65">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I want to work in man I want to work in literature.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a34" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts66" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts67">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>And from there I went to geometematics and then geometrics and statistics as a weird weird traveler Eric, what year was that you approached first?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a36" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts70" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts71">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Risky Well try and work it out If it was still the war.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a37" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts72" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts73">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh yeah yeah it wasn't long after you came to Berkeley then?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a38" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts74" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts75">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was probably forty three forty three forty three forty three.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
			</ANNOTATION>
		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a39" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts76" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts77">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>Had you had a course with Dursty?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
